# Only lint the website — ignore everything else
*
!website/
!website/**
# `eleventy.config.js` builds that website and is named explicitly by
# `lint:format`, `fmt:website` and the prettier hook. Without this line prettier
# reports `{"ignored": true}` for it and all three exit 0 with "All matched files
# use Prettier code style!" — it warns nothing when an explicitly-named file is
# ignored, so the gate was dead rather than passing.
!eleventy.config.js
